icial Kotlin 2.0.0 release notes. Here's a summary of the key highlights:&#10;&#10;Kotlin 2.0.0 Release Notes (Released May 21, 2024)&#10;&#10;&#127919; Headline&#10;&#10;K2 compiler is now Stable and used by default for all targets (JVM, Native, JS, Wasm). It brings major performance improvements, faster language feature development, and better multiplatform architecture.&#10;&#10;Major Highlights&#10;&#10;New Compose compiler Gradle plugin&#10;Generation of lambda functions using invokedynamic&#10;kotlinx-metadata-jvm library is now Stable&#10;Monitoring GC performance in Kotlin/Native (Apple signposts)&#10;Resolving conflicts with Objective-C methods (Kotlin/Native)&#10;Named exports &amp; unsigned primitive types support in Kotlin/Wasm ( @JsExport )&#10;Optimize production builds by default using Binaryen (Wasm)&#10;New Gradle DSL for compiler options in multiplatform projects&#10;Stable replacement of  enum class values  generic function&#10;Stable  AutoCloseable  interface&#10;&#10;Language &amp; Compiler Improvements&#10;&#10;Smart cast improvements: local variables in scopes, type checks with  || , inline functions (implicit  callsInPlace ), properties with function types, exception handling ( catch / finally ), increment/decrement operators.&#10;Kotlin Multiplatform: strict separation of common vs. platform source sets at compile time; different visibility levels for  expect / actual  declarations.&#10;&#10;IDE / Build&#10;&#10;Kotlin plugins bundled in latest IntelliJ IDEA &amp; Android Studio; just update the version in build scripts.&#10;K2 migration guide available; limitations noted for Gradle &lt; 8.3 (buildSrc, included builds, etc.).&#10;&#10;References&#10;&#10;Official docs: https://kotlinlang.org/docs/whatsnew20.html&#10;JetBrains blog (2.0.20): https://blog.jetbrains.com/kotlin/2024/08/kotlin-2-0-20-released/&#10;Baeldung overview: https://www.baeldung.com/kotlin/version-2-new-features&#10;&#10;Would you like me to fetch details on a specific ar